    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to bring to the market this well-located three-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in the established residential development of Woodlands, Oakpark, Tralee.\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned throughout and comprises a living room, dining room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a family bathroom, together with large rear utility room. \n\nThe property offers excellent potential for those seeking comfortable single-level living, with scope to modernise and personalise to their own taste.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear garden and off-street parking. Its position at the end of the cul-de-sac provides a particularly peaceful setting with good privacy.\n\nFeatures include a large rear utility, and impressive patio style rear garden and high spec modernised bathroom.\n\nWoodlands enjoys a convenient location within easy reach of Tralee Town Centre and a host of local amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities and public transport links. Tralee Town Park, University Hospital Kerry and Manor West Retail Park are also within easy reach.\n\nThis property will appeal to first-time buyers, families, downsizers and investors alike, offering well-proportioned accommodation in a mature and convenient residential location."
      },
